{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/trig-ratios/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/trig-ratios.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Trigonometric Ratios — sin, cos, tan","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<header class=\"bg-green-600 text-white py-3 mb-6\">\n    <div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 flex items-center justify-between\">\n      <div class=\"font-semibold\">Trigonometric Ratios</div>\n      <a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/geometry-trigonometry/\" class=\"text-white/90\">Back</a>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 space-y-6\">\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Definitions</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-2 text-gray-700\">\n        <div><strong>sin θ</strong> = opposite / hypotenuse</div>\n        <div><strong>cos θ</strong> = adjacent / hypotenuse</div>\n        <div><strong>tan θ</strong> = opposite / adjacent = sin θ / cos θ</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Exact values</h2>\n      <div class=\"mt-2 mono text-sm text-gray-700\">\n        sin30 = 1/2, cos30 = √3/2, tan30 = 1/√3<br>\n        sin45 = √2/2, cos45 = √2/2, tan45 = 1<br>\n        sin60 = √3/2, cos60 = 1/2, tan60 = √3\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"card\">\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg font-semibold\">Practice</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mt-3\">\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">1) Find sin30° (exact)</div>\n          <input id=\"r1\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1/2\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"rc1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-green-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"rh1\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"rfb1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-gray-50 rounded\">\n          <div class=\"font-medium\">2) tan45° = ?</div>\n          <input id=\"r2\" class=\"mt-2 p-2 border rounded w-full\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1\">\n          <div class=\"mt-2 flex gap-2\"><button id=\"rc2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-green-600 text-white rounded\">Check</button><button id=\"rh2\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Hint</button></div>\n          <div id=\"rfb2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <div class=\"text-right\"><button id=\"trQuiz\" class=\"bg-green-600 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded\">Open Quiz</button></div>\n  </main>\n\n  <div id=\"trModal\" class=\"hidden fixed inset-0 bg-black/40 flex items-center justify-center z-40\">\n    <div class=\"bg-white rounded p-6 max-w-md w-full\">\n      <div id=\"trContent\"></div>\n      <div class=\"mt-4 text-right\"><button id=\"trClose\" class=\"px-3 py-1 border rounded\">Close</button></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"bg-green-50 font-sans","bodyStyle":"","css":[".card{background:#fff;padding:1rem;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.06)} .mono{font-family:ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, \"Roboto Mono\", \"Helvetica Neue\", monospace}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}